{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司被指曾向其首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo的零部件供應商Fine M-Tec施加壓力，要求對方撤回一份否認自身零部件存在質量問題的公開聲明。隨着屏幕開裂事件持續發酵，這家韓國供應商與蘋果之間的關係也受到關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586828.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.139642+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:36:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_hash":"583fafcddd3662c3e8fc8587295a0f76b54fd172d597776aec3423e471a87c36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}